      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-03-20T16:41:43.018Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Welcome! Glad you found the game! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\"></p>\n<p>They haven’t mentioned anything like that, that I’ve heard. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=12\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"> However, there is the neoprene map of the thematic board that is great, if you think you’d enjoy that. (The new one, not the old one. The new one <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/spirit-island-jagged-earth/description\">came with the Jagger Earth Kickstarter</a> and is great for use with the game. The old one is basically a beautiful poster. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> ) Not sure where it’s available, though, unfortunately. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/thinking.png?v=12\" title=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":thinking:\"></p>\n<p>But you could contact GTG directly at <a href=\"mailto:contact@greaterthangames.com\">contact@greaterthangames.com</a> to ask about potential future options. If they get enough requests, they might consider it – or at least make replacement boards available.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-03-20T16:41:43.018Z",
